// A pvp system generator. The `modes/pvp/` path rule plus the top-level `Spawners` field roots this
// file as a SimulationGenerator, whose `Spawners` is `list<SimSpawner>`: a polymorphic slot, where
// each element names its own class through its own `Type=`. The action-rooting fixture mod appends
// whole-file spawner fragments to it.
Spawners
[
	{
		Type = None
		Count = 1
	}
]
